# **5. Sentinel-2 Clipping and Visualization**

This section clips the Sentinel-2 Level-2A bands to the Ben Ahmed analytical boundary.

The clipped bands are used to produce:

- a true-color representation of the study area; and
- an NDVI map representing relative vegetation greenness.

Sentinel-2 is a multispectral source and is used here for the real Ben Ahmed spatial context. It is not treated as hyperspectral data.

