Crop Coverage  

The GAEZ crop-suitability screening was limited to crops for which matching datasets could be identified and downloaded under the selected historical, rain-fed, and input-management scenario. Matching layers were available for wheat, barley, and maize, with chickpea included where available.

No matching layers were identified for lentil and faba bean under the same selector configuration. These crops were therefore not assigned invented or substitute GAEZ scores. They were excluded from the GAEZ-based comparison and recorded as having unavailable external suitability evidence.

This data-availability limitation does not demonstrate that lentil or faba bean are unsuitable for the study area. It indicates only that matching layers were not identified in the selected GAEZ product and configuration.
crop_code_mapping = {
