### 13.1.1 Model settings and weights

The weights sum to 1. The environmental and water components receive the largest shares, while objective, feed, rotation, diversity, and soil-health components provide additional differentiation.

MINIMUM_SUITABILITY = 0.40
MAXIMUM_CROPS_PER_FARM = 5

