The recommended allocation contains only crops that can be considered under the prototype rain-fed conditions. Irrigation-dependent alfalfa was excluded because irrigation is unavailable. Maize was also excluded because it requires irrigation and its aligned environmental suitability was below the prototype eligibility threshold.

