Barley and forage oats provide the main feed-oriented components of the recommended allocation. Faba bean also provides a moderate direct and residue-feed contribution. The recommended forage-oats area of approximately 1.98 hectares is close to the indicative minimum forage area of 1.85 hectares, although actual feed production cannot be confirmed without local yield, feed-quality, and seasonal information.

