The diversity-aware recommendation distributes the farm across five crops and two principal crop families. The regional diversity mechanism slightly adjusts the crop rankings according to crop and crop-family shares already allocated in preceding synthetic scenarios. It does not force an unsuitable crop into the recommendation.

