The recommendation is based on a synthetic farmer scenario, regional environmental summaries, prototype crop attributes, and assumption-based feed coefficients. Faba bean, lentil, and forage oats use provisional suitability assumptions because matching GAEZ layers were not included for these crops. The recommendation should therefore be interpreted as a prototype decision-support demonstration rather than a validated farm prescription.
